{"4810650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Tides Draga's Wake", "steam_appid": 4810650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead men tell no tales. The living only scream.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new era of survival horror arrives with <strong>Black Tides: Draga's Wake</strong>. Step into the boots of Draga, a hardened smuggler and pirate first mate whose ultimate heist has gone catastrophically wrong. Trapped aboard the <i>Ormora</i>—a decaying 1900s steamship icelocked in unpredictable waters—you must navigate a labyrinth of iron to find your missing crew while fighting a losing battle against the ritualistic, cosmic horrors that have breached our reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmare of Flesh and Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an oppressive landscape dominated by riveted steel, hiss-venting steam pipes, and failing turn-of-the-century machinery. The <i>Ormora</i> isn't just a backdrop—it's a claustrophobic, labyrinthine character in itself, built to disorient you and harbor ritualistic, cosmic horrors that have manifested within the ship's flooded lower decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAGA BOLIVAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardened sailor and career thief who has spent his life following Caleb's orders without question — until the Ormora forces him to question everything. Draga is not a hero. He is a survivor, a loyalist, and a man whose moral code was built for a simpler world. As the ship's horrors consume his crew one by one and an ancient god takes root in his body, Draga must choose between the man he was and the something terrifying he is becoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Izzy Koleva</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former cultist who escaped the Children of Gaia's grip — but not its influence. Izzy knows the rituals, the doctrine, and the lies. Skilled in alchemy, she is one of the few people alive who truly understands what the cult is trying to do, and what it will cost if they succeed. Draga doesn't trust her. He may not have a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VISCERAL, HIGH-STAKES BRAWLER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn't just about running away; it's about fighting back with everything you have. Engage in brutal, close-quarters combat against twisted, mutated entities. Every strike has weight, every impact is visceral, and every mistake is costly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Melee &amp; Dodge:</strong> Rely on your reflexes and wits. Perfect your timing to dodge devastating enemy attacks and unleash heavy brawler-style combos to tear through flesh and bone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick-Fire Under Pressure:</strong> Seamlessly weave ranged quick-fire attacks into your melee flow to keep aggressive monstrosities at bay or exploit sudden openings in their defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruthless Resource Management:</strong> Ammo, health, and power are scarce. Every encounter requires you to calculate the cost of engagement. Will you burn your precious resources to guarantee a kill, or risk getting up close and personal to save them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unforgiving Body Horror Nightmare:</strong> Navigate a grim, custom-built world steeped in atmospheric dread, graphic gore, and grotesque anatomical terrors where danger lurks in every shadow and victory is bought in blood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/eb9f7ae858cd4b7cc9f702300c4b3e23.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead men tell no tales. The living only scream.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new era of survival horror arrives with <strong>Black Tides: Draga's Wake</strong>. Step into the boots of Draga, a hardened smuggler and pirate first mate whose ultimate heist has gone catastrophically wrong. Trapped aboard the <i>Ormora</i>—a decaying 1900s steamship icelocked in unpredictable waters—you must navigate a labyrinth of iron to find your missing crew while fighting a losing battle against the ritualistic, cosmic horrors that have breached our reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmare of Flesh and Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an oppressive landscape dominated by riveted steel, hiss-venting steam pipes, and failing turn-of-the-century machinery. The <i>Ormora</i> isn't just a backdrop—it's a claustrophobic, labyrinthine character in itself, built to disorient you and harbor ritualistic, cosmic horrors that have manifested within the ship's flooded lower decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b6b188508eccf270aa135086e8f09193.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAGA BOLIVAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardened sailor and career thief who has spent his life following Caleb's orders without question — until the Ormora forces him to question everything. Draga is not a hero. He is a survivor, a loyalist, and a man whose moral code was built for a simpler world. As the ship's horrors consume his crew one by one and an ancient god takes root in his body, Draga must choose between the man he was and the something terrifying he is becoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/2ab498585d85004fbb35972ad80f5736.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Izzy Koleva</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former cultist who escaped the Children of Gaia's grip — but not its influence. Izzy knows the rituals, the doctrine, and the lies. Skilled in alchemy, she is one of the few people alive who truly understands what the cult is trying to do, and what it will cost if they succeed. Draga doesn't trust her. He may not have a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/b45a1523e21fa2b154331e509c60968f.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VISCERAL, HIGH-STAKES BRAWLER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn't just about running away; it's about fighting back with everything you have. Engage in brutal, close-quarters combat against twisted, mutated entities. Every strike has weight, every impact is visceral, and every mistake is costly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Melee &amp; Dodge:</strong> Rely on your reflexes and wits. Perfect your timing to dodge devastating enemy attacks and unleash heavy brawler-style combos to tear through flesh and bone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick-Fire Under Pressure:</strong> Seamlessly weave ranged quick-fire attacks into your melee flow to keep aggressive monstrosities at bay or exploit sudden openings in their defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruthless Resource Management:</strong> Ammo, health, and power are scarce. Every encounter requires you to calculate the cost of engagement. Will you burn your precious resources to guarantee a kill, or risk getting up close and personal to save them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unforgiving Body Horror Nightmare:</strong> Navigate a grim, custom-built world steeped in atmospheric dread, graphic gore, and grotesque anatomical terrors where danger lurks in every shadow and victory is bought in blood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.poster.avif?t=1782837623\" width=790 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.webm?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/extras/48e18ae1c13435abc8eb6ff83fb86255.mp4?t=1782837623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Draga is running out of time and humanity. Stranded on a nightmare colossal steamship in an alternate 1900s, unleash visceral brawler combat against twisted horrors below deck. Regroup your scattered crew and uncover what’s awakening inside the hull… before escape becomes impossible.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Ukrainian, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/9a8ab82852417bea91ca9ec03d52df24f4b112ce/header.jpg?t=1782837623", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/d03ef93d959c624b4beea6d0792be75b23ee5e7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782837623", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810650/d03ef93d959c624b4beea6d0792be75b23ee5e7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782837623", "website": "https://strangecreaturefactory.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  MICROSOFT WINDOWS 10/11, 64-BIT<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  INTEL CORE i5 9500, AMD RYZEN 5 3500<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MSI Gaming GeForce RTX 2060</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  MICROSOFT WINDOWS 10/11, 64-BIT<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3080</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Strange Creature Factory Ltd"], "publ